      "cooked": "<p>Just got KOd by The Chairman with Undivided Attention. Chariman was down, but the Operative had 21 HP left. Expatriette went down from the Operative's attack when Undivided Attention came out, and then Wraith fell to it from the Chairman's portion of the damage. How can a target that's no longer in the game deal damage?<br><br>Granted, I probably would have still lost regardless, but still doesn't make much sense this way.</p>",
